rnet (1GE) LAN port, the GS PG100 delivers stable Gigabit-speed internet for HD video streaming, online gaming, VoIP, and smart home applications. Its compact design, low power consumption, and plug-and-play installation make it an ideal solution for Fiber-to-the-Home (FTTH) deployments.</p><p><br></p><p>The GS PG100 offers reliable optical performance with transmission distances of up to 20 km over single-mode fiber, making it suitable for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), enterprise networks, and broadband service deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Supports GPON &amp; EPON (XPON) dual-mode operation</li><li>Automatic GPON/EPON mode detection</li><li>1 × Gigabit Ethernet (10/100/1000 Mbps) LAN port</li><li>High-speed FTTH broadband connectivity</li><li>Supports transmission distance up to 20 km</li><li>SC/APC optical connector</li><li>Compact and lightweight design</li><li>Plug-and-play installation</li><li>Low power consumption</li><li>Stable and reliable optical transmission</li><li>Compatible with most mainstream OLT brands</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n   